      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm working on a curriculum module for a high school sociology class about structural inequality. can you help me put together a teaching guide that explains how systemic racism actually operates within the housing and banking sectors? i want a clear breakdown of the mechanisms so students can understand the impact. thanks!",
